<!--
  Hub studio · `/studio/agents` — the agents list index.

  Composes the `@ship/agents` pack's <ship-agent-list>, which owns
  the data wiring (ship.agents.summaries() via live() inside the
  controller) and the search/filter state. The route is a thin
  composition — chrome is the root layout, the page body is the pack
  composite.

  Top chrome: the <ship-nav-top> is owned by the root layout
  (`routes/_layout.sui` → `<ship-app-chrome>`).

  Per the hub-buildout-charter §Connect-only, the list is wired to the
  real Connect SDK op `ship.agents.summaries()`. No backend gap on
  this surface — the SDK exposes the op (`packages/deck/sdk-client/
  src/ship-sdk.ts::agents.summaries`) and the payload shape is
  narrowed locally in the pack's controller (the same pattern the
  shell's studio/agents and the home pack's <ship-activity-runs> use).
-->
<main class="studio-agents">
  <ship-agent-list></ship-agent-list>
</main>
